Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted), not submitted upstream.
Use selected od/lipo/otool commands for Mach-O checks and package metadata.
Do not depend on file/libmagic: that creates a cycle with native libtool-base.
Keep signature filtering separate from the platform object parser.
The Java-overlap filter follows LLVM BinaryFormat/Magic.cpp identify_magic:
https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/blob/llvmorg-23.1.4/llvm/lib/BinaryFormat/Magic.cpp

